Variables --> storing values [number, decimal number, char, boolean, String]
Math Operations --> I/I, I/D, I%I, i++,++i, i--, --i
String Concatenation

Statements:  Whenever we have to make some decision/s
-if else

  if(condition)
  {
     Code here will execute only if condition is true
  }
  else
  {
    Code here will execute only if condition is false
  }


-if else if

  if(condition 1)
  {
     Code here will execute only if condition1 is true
  }
  else if(condition2)
  {
     Code here will execute only if condition1 is true
  }
  else if(condition3)
  {
     Code here will execute only if condition3 is true
  }
  else if(condition n)
  {
     Code here will execute only if condition1 is true
  }
  else
  {
    Code here will execute only if condition is false
  }

-switch Statement